00:01:36.009 --> 00:01:39.900
[Abyss]

00:01:45.759 --> 00:01:47.870
[Abyss]

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:51.350
[Chapter 6]

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:53.910
[Copy]

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:54.979
[Abyss]

00:01:54.979 --> 00:01:55.630
[Dingdian Novel Website]
[Homepage, User Setup 1]

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.030
[Abyss] [Author: Han Sheng]

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:58.080
[Upload]

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.020
[Paste]

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:06.410
[Chapter]
[Chapter 6]

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.550
[Post]

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:10.620
[Chapter 6 of "Abyss"]
[Successfully Uploaded]

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:13.560
I didn't have the courage

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.030
to confront that woman named Gu Fang.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.780
But I had my own ways.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.710
I took advantage of the factory's
holiday closure

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:27.510
and sneaked into the area
where that vixen worked,

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.660
intending to find a conspicuous spot

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:32.780
to write down the fact
that she seduced a married man.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.030
Help!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.780
Come save me!

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.310
Mom!

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:49.930
Mom, save me!

00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:50.910
Mom!

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:53.400
No! Don't!

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:00.300
Mom, save me!

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:06.860
Help!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.030
Help!

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:18.030
Maybe I should have died on that day.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.760
Maybe I already died on that day.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.820
They forced me to look directly at evil,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.200
making me watch their revelry
as a helpless observer,

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.130
but I had no choice.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:40.220
[Episode 2]

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.250
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.360
Why did you tell him

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:45.690
to follow me?

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:49.220
Why were you following him?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.360
What should I call you, sir?

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.590
Sir?

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.210
This old man is Xin Jiran.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.090
I noticed you were following Han Pinmu,

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.460
so I wanted to figure out
who you really were.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.340
I thought someone took the bait.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.180
What a disappointment.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:10.860
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.450
You brought him in, so you deal with him.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:17.700
Li Cheng.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.120
Do you even understand what an order is?

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.830
I don't.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.360
Strictly speaking,

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.950
I'm not an official police officer yet.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.510
Do you believe

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.440
I can make sure you never get hired?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.310
I believe you.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.720
But I might also tell everything
that's happened recently

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:36.860
to my future chief, Wang Zhengcao.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.659
I could even report you
to the Internal Affairs Brigade

00:04:39.659 --> 00:04:41.370
for violating procedures

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.420
by privately involving
an unappointed officer

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.620
in an investigation.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:47.100
I...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.960
I just asked you to play a game.

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.040
What kind of undercover work is that?

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.020
Then I could also tell Han Pinmu

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.720
that I'm a reserve police officer.

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.890
You said he wasn't a suspect anyway.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.920
Li Guangwen totally set me up.

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.430
You're anything but innocent.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:05.720
You're a real handful!

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.930
I told you not to involve anyone else.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.590
You brought this on yourself.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:13.040
Li Cheng.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.390
What exactly do you want?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.510
I just want to figure out

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.120
why you are investigating Han Pinmu.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.040
Didn't I tell you

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.450
I'd tell you later?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.620
I want to know now.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:23.540
Not now.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:24.560
You're not in
the Criminal Investigation Corps.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:25.500
Neither is he.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.270
His situation is special.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:27.270
He used to be in it.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:28.330
And I will be in the future.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.130
Then I'll tell you in the future.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:38.400
Now,

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.690
I've established contact with Han Pinmu.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.570
He has a QQ gaming group,

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.220
and it's full of his friends.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.680
As long as I can get into that group,

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:46.860
I can help you.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.480
Maybe from the very beginning,

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.230
I was just a minor detail to you.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.659
But I'm confident

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.280
that I can play a bigger role.

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:57.010
As long as your objective
doesn't go against my principles,

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:57.890
I promise

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.430
I can keep it a secret.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.980
What principles?

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.420
Upholding justice and serving the people.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:09.420
Are you serious?

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.360
Of course.

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:13.560
That's why I became a police officer
in the first place.

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.890
Didn't you say

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.690
it was because being a cop is impressive?

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.140
That's what my mom told me to say.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:22.330
She said it'd sound more sincere that way.

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.860
Telling the truth would sound
more like a lie.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:51.540
Captain. Captain.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:52.240
Captain.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.860
Wait, just tell me
if you think he looks like him too.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:56.990
Tell me—doesn't he?

00:07:21.860 --> 00:07:23.190
You're from Huangshui?

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.540
Yes.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:28.360
Then have you heard of

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.630
the major case that happened here
8 years ago,

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.170
which shocked the entire province?

00:07:37.159 --> 00:07:38.590
The 312 Case?

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:39.220
The first case

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.390
[March 12, 2004]

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.060
took place on March 12,

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:42.210
2004.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:43.560
[Outskirts of Huangshui County]
[Victims: Li Yaoming, Li Fang]

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.040
The victims were

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.360
Li Yaoming and his wife, Li Fang.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.940
The temperature was very low that day,

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.940
and the crime scene was very remote.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:58.550
Both victims

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.870
died of penetrating wounds
from a sharp weapon.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.300
The murder weapon was the same.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.120
The suspect killed and robbed for money,

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.820
and the modus operandi
was extremely brutal.

00:08:06.930 --> 00:08:09.510
To snatch the jade bracelet
on Li Fang's wrist,

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.480
the murderer almost severed her left hand.

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:12.830
Alright, alright. Stop.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.980
I'll take it from here.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:16.680
There were a total of 5 cases
in the 312 series of cases.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.610
Xin was referring to the first one.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:19.870
On March 20,

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:20.160
[March 20, 2004] [Changshui Road]

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.930
we found the bodies of Zhang Lina

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:22.660
and her daughter Wang Ping

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.100
[Pharmaceutical Factory's Warehouse]
[Victims: Zhang Lina, Wang Ping]

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.010
in the pharmaceutical factory's warehouse
on Changshui Road.

00:08:25.010 --> 00:08:26.760
The daughter, Wang Ping,
was only 17 years old,

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:28.600
and she had been sexually assaulted
before her death.

00:08:28.600 --> 00:08:31.010
All valuables at the scene
had been looted.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.230
On April 5,

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:32.580
[April 5, 2004]

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:34.210
Liu Xiaohua, a worker
at Youxin Chemical Plant,

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:34.890
[Youxin Chemical Plant]
[Victim: Liu Xiaohua]

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:37.669
was robbed, raped, and murdered
on her way home from work.

00:08:37.669 --> 00:08:39.390
Her body was found
in an unfinished building

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.100
near the chemical plant.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:42.250
On April 17,

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.100
[April 17, 2004]

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.650
Du Juan, a female teacher
at a technical school,

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:45.280
died in the staff dormitory.

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:46.440
[Technical School Staff Dormitory]
[Victim: Du Juan]

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.910
She was stabbed 3 times in the abdomen,

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:48.480
[Filming]

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:49.840
but the cause of death was a heart attack.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.580
She had not been sexually assaulted.

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:54.170
It's speculated that during the crime,

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.000
the victim suddenly had a heart attack,

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.530
so the suspect stopped.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.720
In the Du Juan case,

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.870
surveillance footage captured
a very blurry image of a person's back,

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:01.010
[Camera 01]

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:04.010
but it did not provide
any particularly useful information.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.000
On April 25,

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.550
Chen Chunli, a fruit vendor,

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:06.870
was robbed by 3 men with knives

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:08.270
[April 25, 2004]

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.260
in a field near the national highway.

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:10.000
[Field near the National Highway]
[Victim: Chen Chunli]

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.010
One of the perpetrators,

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:12.770
while attempting rape,

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:15.300
was hit on the head with a stone
by Chen Chunli.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.290
The victim's fierce resistance

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:19.870
angered the suspects.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:22.470
Chen Chunli was stabbed 3 times
in the abdomen.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.790
Fortunately,

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.480
after the perpetrators left,

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.550
Chen Chunli crawled to
the side of the road

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.670
and was saved by a truck driver.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:41.080
The victim survived?

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:42.160
Yes.

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.980
Wouldn't it be easy
to find the suspects then?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.440
According to Chen Chunli,

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:47.890
she was walking on the road

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.270
when she was attacked from behind

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:50.510
and dragged into the field.

00:09:50.510 --> 00:09:52.360
The situation at the time
was extremely chaotic.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.080
She didn't see the faces of
the 3 perpetrators clearly.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.320
She could only roughly tell

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.520
that they seemed to be

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.840
2 middle-aged men and 1 young man,

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:00.910
all speaking with a local accent.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.340
You just mentioned

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.980
that one of them had his head smashed.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:07.340
You're very sharp.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.600
At the primary crime scene,

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.460
we extracted a blood sample
belonging to one of the suspects

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.480
from a rock.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.360
In addition, in the third case,

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:17.410
we recovered skin flakes
from another suspect

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:20.230
under the fingernails of
the victim Liu Xiaohua.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:21.700
These two findings are the main basis

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.300
for our subsequent
screening and comparison.

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:27.270
But I remember the news said

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.250
that the 312 Case had already been solved.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:33.720
We did, in fact,

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.580
find one of the suspects,

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:36.940
Bi Dehua, 6 months later.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.840
He was a worker at Youxin Chemical Plant,

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.370
a colleague of Liu Xiaohua,

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:43.340
who had pursued her but was rejected.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:44.370
His DNA

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.820
didn't match the skin flakes
under Liu Xiaohua's nails,

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:49.960
but it matched the blood on the rock.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.390
We can basically confirm

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.310
that he was one of the 3 suspects.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.650
The problem is that when we found him,

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:58.390
he had already been killed.

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.610
So the other two
haven't been found to this day?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:05.550
No.

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:08.980
How many people died?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.720
Those who died directly in this case...

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:14.320
Seven.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.780
Including Bi Dehua, it's 7.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.050
What does Han Pinmu have to do
with this case?

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:28.030
Du Juan, the victim of the fourth case,

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.380
was Han Pinmu's stepmother.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.930
He's a family member of
one of the victims?

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:33.560
Yes.

00:11:35.150 --> 00:11:37.050
He didn't get along well with Du Juan.

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.120
Back then, we also included him

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:39.910
in the scope of the investigation,

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.840
but there was no evidence pointing to him.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:44.500
He was 20 years old then,

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.580
working as an attendant
in an internet cafe.

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.600
The first and third cases,
and the fourth case involving Du Juan,

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.700
all happened when he was working.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.700
We could basically rule out

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.510
the possibility of him
committing the crime directly.

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:55.460
Later, we discovered

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:58.440
that Han Pinmu knew
many details of the case.

00:11:58.540 --> 00:11:59.510
How did you know

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:02.030
that Han Pinmu knew the details
of the case?

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.550
Now that it's come to this,

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:14.570
there's nothing that can't be said.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.500
Two months ago,

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.120
I received a package.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.220
Inside was half a novel.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.600
[Abyss]

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.890
The novel was obviously
based on the 3/12 Case.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.170
Many of the plots in it

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.940
matched the actual case.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.940
I found this novel online.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.540
Zhao Ganzhe asked
the technicians to check,

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.600
and they confirmed
that the author of the novel

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:46.650
is Han Pinmu.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:49.440
Who sent you this novel?

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.060
No idea.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.000
If Han Pinmu really was involved,

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:56.050
then why would he turn this story

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:57.320
into a novel?

00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.530
Could it be that he's trying to
hint at something

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.860
and reopen the case?

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:04.520
I'd also like to know.

00:13:05.320 --> 00:13:07.250
So you want to figure out

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.200
Han Pinmu's channels
for getting this information?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:12.130
Han Pinmu's social circle is very small—

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:14.530
basically just people he plays games with.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.770
If you can infiltrate his gaming circle,

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.340
we might be able to uncover something new.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.240
Then why did you insist on
investigating it yourselves

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.640
instead of reporting it?

00:13:24.710 --> 00:13:26.590
Didn't I tell you?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.340
There's politics everywhere.

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:31.700
Xin used to be our captain,

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:33.840
and "Speedster" was my subordinate.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.130
"Speedster"?

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.440
Who's "Speedster"?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.890
It's our Captain Fan.

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.840
He's quicker than anyone else
when it comes to drinking

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.550
and taking credit,
so we gave him the nickname

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.550
"Speedster Fan."

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:47.720
Alright, cut the irrelevant talk.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.550
Anyway, it's been 8 years.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.620
Just a fictional novel

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.010
isn't enough for the bureau
to fully reopen the investigation.

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.600
There must be substantial evidence.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.200
Understood.

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:06.050
Now that we've told you
such important leads,

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.380
you won't turn around

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:09.100
and sell us out, will you?

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.660
Of course not.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.340
So do the three of us

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.870
count as the legendary

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:17.350
Major Case Task Force now?

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:21.700
I guess so.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.510
Comrade Li Cheng.

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:28.790
I hereby announce that

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.580
this is no longer a test,

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.860
but a mission between you and me.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.320
The mission:

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:36.910
join Han Pinmu's gaming group ASAP,

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.100
check whether there are
any suspicious individuals in the group,

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.330
identify Han Pinmu's sources
of information,

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.880
and figure out the purpose
behind his novel.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.100
The deadline is extended to half a month.

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:47.510
Are you confident you can do this?

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:48.260
Yes, sir!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.200
For safety's sake,

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:52.150
let's each come up with a code name

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:55.320
and use them during the operation.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.910
Call me Big Red Date.

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:00.850
Call him Old Foodie.

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:08.130
Elite Student.

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.050
Elite...

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:12.000
Elite Student.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.960
I wish you success then.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.650
I'll live up to the mission!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.240
The victim couple of the first case—

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:45.590
was the wife sexually assaulted?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.500
[Victim No. 1] [Victim No. 2]
[Victim No. 3]

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:46.700
No.

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:47.470
[Li Yaoming] [Li Fang]

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:48.730
When the suspects
committed sexual assaults,

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:49.790
[Victim No. 2]

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:50.020
did they leave any DNA?

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:50.480
[Mother‑Daughter Bodies Found
in a Pharma Warehouse]

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:50.680
[On Changshui Road, Huangshui County]

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:51.410
[Youxin Chemical Plant Female Worker
Killed Off‑shift]

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:51.670
No. They were very careful.

00:15:51.670 --> 00:15:52.760
[Crime Scene: Nearby Farmland]

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:55.860
They probably used condoms every time.

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.830
Since the circumstances of each case
were different,

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.160
why did the police

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.990
think they were committed
by the same group of people?

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.360
What was the basis for
linking the cases together?

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:03.910
The main evidence was

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.200
the triangular dagger we found

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:07.620
in Bi Dehua's house.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.120
According to the technical appraisal,

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.510
blood traces of all the victims

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.860
were found on that dagger.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.840
What does Han Pinmu have to do
with this case?

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:16.190
Du Juan, the victim of the fourth case,

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:19.280
[Victim No. 4, Du Juan]

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.310
was Han Pinmu's stepmother.

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:22.530
[Victim No. 4, Du Juan]
[Stepmother] [Han Pinmu]

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:24.540
He's a family member of
one of the victims?

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:25.080
Yes.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:27.010
Is this Chen Chunli

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:28.870
the same Chen Chunli from before?

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:30.940
Three months ago,

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.750
Chen Chunli suddenly came to me

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:35.440
and told me she got another job.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:35.650
At her new workplace,

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:36.860
[Huangzhiyuan Hotel]

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.030
there was a colleague

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:40.360
who looked a lot like
one of the 3 suspects.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.010
-I caused a scene at that hotel
-Chunli!

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:44.650
-just to get access to that person.
-Chen Chunli!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.000
But not long after,

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.660
Chen Chunli changed her story

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.480
and said she mistook him for someone else.

00:16:50.480 --> 00:16:52.370
The person you're talking about is...

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:54.240
The hotel parking lot attendant,

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.500
Song Laifu.

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.040
I picked a fight with Song Laifu
on purpose,

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.730
and we compared his hair

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:03.370
with the skin flakes found under

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:04.640
Liu Xiaohua's fingernails.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:05.380
The results

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:07.730
didn't match.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:08.630
[Victim No. 5: Chen Chunli]

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:09.430
But there are 2 suspects at large.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:10.869
[Song Laifu]

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:12.180
[Chen Chunli] [Song Laifu]

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:14.180
We can't completely rule him out.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.200
Captain Fan.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:32.770
Captain Fan.

00:17:32.770 --> 00:17:33.500
Captain Fan.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.430
Captain Fan.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.480
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:47.530
Sneaking snacks in the office again, huh?

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:49.590
Am I eating your snacks or something?

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:52.610
Why don't you ask Xin to join you?

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:54.140
Wouldn't the two of you
sneaking snacks together

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:55.310
be more exciting?

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.240
Is beating around the bush any fun?

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:58.970
Zhao Ganzhe.

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:01.420
If Xin Jiran needs any help,

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.110
I can help him.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.180
Go ask him.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.130
How would I know?

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.200
Let me ask you—

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.350
are you helping him
investigate the 3/12 Case or not?

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.160
No.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.400
Even if you wanted me to help him,

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:18.420
I might not have the time.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:19.880
Stop playing dumb with me!

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:26.180
If Xin has broken the law,

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:27.550
I can lead a team to arrest him.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.510
If not,

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:29.900
just go about your business.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:31.790
Don't stand here blowing up at me.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:32.850
He's not a police officer.

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.290
He doesn't have police credentials,

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.720
yet he's doing the work of
a police officer!

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.270
You're putting him in danger!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:37.850
Tell him

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.720
to do his job well and live a normal life.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:40.660
That matters more than anything else!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:41.310
Nonsense!

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.980
Seven people died in the 3/12 Case!

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.070
He lost his wife and child,

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.240
got stripped of his uniform,

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.790
and did 6 years of time alone in prison!

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.310
How do you expect him
to live a normal life?

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:51.790
I know he can't get over

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.980
what happened to his wife and child.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.420
But will the state
make an exception for him?

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.140
What good would it do him

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:58.250
to desperately dig into the 3/12 Case?

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.310
Fine, fine.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.900
I won't talk more about
Xin's family affairs.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:01.790
He's been out of prison for 2 years,

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:03.480
and has behaved well as a citizen.

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.680
As long as he doesn't break the law,

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.210
he can do whatever he wants.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.380
Is it any of your business?

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:08.590
He's behaved well?

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.160
Complaints about Huangzhiyuan

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:11.480
have even reached
the municipal government.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.610
If it weren't for you, Wang Zhengcao,

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:13.510
and that Li Guangwen

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.550
covering for him

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.790
and helping him get by,

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.810
he'd be well on his way
back to prison by now.

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:18.530
I'm telling you,

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:20.030
if you reveal any details of the case
to him again,

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.350
even I won't be able to protect you!

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.550
Thanks for the reminder, Captain Fan.

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.380
If I do anything against the rules,

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:27.980
I promise I won't tell you.

00:19:28.000 --> 00:19:28.870
Zhao Ganzhe!

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:13.500
Mom.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.160
I remember you have a colleague
named Chen Chunli, right?

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.740
Why are you asking about her?

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.550
I've been helping my boss
with some errands lately.

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:23.940
She's somewhat related to the drunkard

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:24.830
that Mr. Li took away.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:25.850
I heard

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:27.700
he went to look for Chen Chunli.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:30.050
I want to know more about
this Chen Chunli.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.090
You can look into her,

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:34.380
but don't get too close.

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.900
That woman has a bad reputation.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.590
Don't let her be a bad influence on you.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.310
Not likely, right?

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.640
How could she be a bad influence on me?

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.850
I'm so young.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.640
Isn't she about your age?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.480
She's younger than me,

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:47.380
but she must be close to 50.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.810
She dressed like she's not even 40.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.790
She really is quite good-looking.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.030
Logically speaking,

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:54.850
she shouldn't have ended up
doing such hard work.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.480
Maybe she just chose the wrong guy.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:59.140
Anyway, there are too many
bad rumors about her.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.270
Bad rumors?

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:02.780
Like what?

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:06.580
She got pregnant and had a child

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.330
when she was only 16 or 17.

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.170
How good could that turn out?

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:11.690
Also, that drunkard

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:13.250
and Song from our workplace

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.040
both fell for Chen Chunli.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.310
Those two often got jealous

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:19.440
and fought over her.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.880
You mean Song who watches the parking lot?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.660
Yeah.

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:24.440
Do you know him well?

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:26.350
Not really.

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:29.430
Song seems like a pretty nice guy.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.250
I don't know how he fell for Chen Chunli.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:34.050
He just stalked her relentlessly.

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:36.060
How could Chen Chunli possibly like him?

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:37.060
Look at him now.

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:38.850
Song, who used to be a decent guy,

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:41.050
has become a laughingstock in our eyes.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.200
I'm telling you, son,

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.000
don't be like that in the future.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.070
When it comes to dating,

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.110
it's all about mutual consent.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:49.530
If anyone's forced, there's no point.

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.160
Mom,

00:21:50.190 --> 00:21:52.030
let me take you to work this morning.

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:56.160
I'll be riding my electric scooter anyway
to run some errands with my boss.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:04.490
Are you Mr. Song?

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:05.630
Who are you?

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:06.720
I'm Li Cheng.

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:08.310
My mom works at this hotel too.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:09.500
Her name is Sun Yuhua.

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:10.960
Anything you need from me?

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:11.750
I just wanted to ask—

00:22:11.750 --> 00:22:13.610
how much does it cost to park here?

00:22:14.980 --> 00:22:17.010
It's free for your electric scooter.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:18.440
Not this one.

00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:24.960
I'm not asking about
this electric scooter.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:26.520
I'm planning to get a loan to buy a car

00:22:26.520 --> 00:22:27.960
and drive my mom to and from work.

00:22:27.960 --> 00:22:28.900
It's very likely that

00:22:28.900 --> 00:22:30.210
I'll park in this parking lot often.

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:31.470
1.5 yuan per hour.

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:32.680
I'm a staff member's family.

00:22:32.680 --> 00:22:34.090
Can't you give me a discount?

00:22:34.090 --> 00:22:35.400
It's hotel policy.

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:37.790
I charge whatever the hotel charges.

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:40.720
What an honest man.

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:46.110
Sir, how long have you been working here?

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:47.170
About 2 or 3 years.

00:22:48.440 --> 00:22:49.110
Why?

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:51.350
Nothing, just asking.

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:52.930
Song.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.590
The logistics department is short-handed
since the alcohol delivery arrived.

00:22:55.590 --> 00:22:56.500
Can you come help out?

00:22:56.500 --> 00:22:57.850
Who's going to watch the pay gate
if I come help?

00:22:57.850 --> 00:22:59.460
If anyone skips out on the fee,
will it be on you or me?

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:01.860
Alright, alright. It'll be on me, alright?

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:03.610
Li Cheng? Is that you?

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:04.400
Manager Zhang.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:05.510
Why are you here?

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:07.270
I came to drop my mom off at work.

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:09.090
What a filial son.

00:23:09.480 --> 00:23:11.180
I heard from your mom
that you took the police exam, right?

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:12.380
Did you pass the exam?

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.360
I did, but I haven't
officially started the job yet.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:16.560
Good for you.

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:19.190
Alright then, I'll get to work.

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:21.330
Do me a favor, Song.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:22.400
See you.

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:23.280
See you.

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:35.070
It's my shift already?

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:37.700
The alarm I set didn't go off.

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:38.750
What time is it?

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:42.430
There's plenty of time left.

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:43.860
I'll sleep a bit more.

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.890
[Abyss]

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:55.260
Song, what's your problem?

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:57.330
If you want to read, go to the lounge.

00:23:59.270 --> 00:24:01.270
Maybe I should have died on that day.

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:03.980
Maybe I already died on that day.

00:24:06.030 --> 00:24:08.230
They forced me to look directly at evil,

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:11.700
making me watch their revelry
as a helpless observer,

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:13.320
but I had no choice.

00:24:14.220 --> 00:24:15.270
Did you hear me? Turn off the light!

00:24:15.270 --> 00:24:16.250
I'm trying to sleep here!

00:24:16.250 --> 00:24:17.780
Make another sound and I'll kill you.

00:24:17.780 --> 00:24:19.130
Kill me right now!

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:21.330
I don't want to live this life anymore
anyway.

00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:22.390
Turn off the light!

00:24:25.310 --> 00:24:26.110
This is a public area.

00:24:26.110 --> 00:24:27.170
Turn the light off!

00:24:29.030 --> 00:24:30.740
Turn it off. Why are you so selfish?

00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:32.470
Turn it off now! I want to sleep.

00:24:34.040 --> 00:24:34.740
Hurry up!

00:24:36.240 --> 00:24:36.830
Song.

00:24:37.700 --> 00:24:39.010
You're on the night shift, right?

00:24:39.010 --> 00:24:41.070
Why did you leave your post
without permission?

00:24:41.070 --> 00:24:41.900
Well,

00:24:42.880 --> 00:24:44.080
this chair is broken,

00:24:44.090 --> 00:24:45.350
so I got a tool to fix it.

00:24:45.950 --> 00:24:47.850
Attack the tower! Attack the tower!

00:24:47.850 --> 00:24:49.510
Go all out! Don't chicken out!

00:24:51.070 --> 00:24:51.890
Nice.

00:24:55.780 --> 00:24:57.440
Hurry up and check your score.

00:24:57.470 --> 00:24:59.400
[Victory]

00:24:59.520 --> 00:24:59.770
[Peak Match Leaderboard]

00:24:59.770 --> 00:25:01.320
One thousand eight hundred and three.

00:25:01.320 --> 00:25:02.220
Not bad.

00:25:02.250 --> 00:25:03.810
You've only been here for a few days.

00:25:03.810 --> 00:25:05.700
You're really going all out
just to join my team.

00:25:05.700 --> 00:25:06.850
Of course.

00:25:06.940 --> 00:25:08.140
Mr. Han, you promised

00:25:08.140 --> 00:25:09.350
that as long as I reach 1,600,

00:25:09.350 --> 00:25:10.250
you'd take me to make a fortune.

00:25:10.250 --> 00:25:12.590
I said we'd make some extra cash.

00:25:12.590 --> 00:25:14.240
How did that turn into "making a fortune"
in your mind?

00:25:14.240 --> 00:25:16.090
I don't care. I want to make a fortune.

00:25:16.090 --> 00:25:17.510
I want to buy a big house for my mom.

00:25:17.510 --> 00:25:19.010
The kinds of ways to make money
you're talking about

00:25:19.010 --> 00:25:21.210
are all written into the criminal code.

00:25:23.830 --> 00:25:24.900
What do you want to drink?

00:25:24.900 --> 00:25:25.900
Anything's fine.

00:25:34.140 --> 00:25:40.550
[Benteng Internet Cafe]

00:25:55.890 --> 00:25:56.820
-Here.
-Thanks.

00:25:58.320 --> 00:25:59.750
I remember you told me last time

00:25:59.750 --> 00:26:02.880
that you used to live in
the chemical plant dorms, right?

00:26:03.070 --> 00:26:03.790
Yes.

00:26:04.460 --> 00:26:06.770
My dad was a technician
at the chemical plant.

00:26:06.770 --> 00:26:09.160
He died in an accident over 10 years ago.

00:26:09.680 --> 00:26:10.770
My mom had felt sad all the time

00:26:10.770 --> 00:26:12.030
living in that house,

00:26:12.030 --> 00:26:13.090
so we moved out.

00:26:14.050 --> 00:26:15.450
It's good that you moved.

00:26:15.730 --> 00:26:17.530
The security there is terrible.

00:26:17.570 --> 00:26:18.920
A few years back, there were
always stories

00:26:18.920 --> 00:26:20.480
about couples walking down the street
in the middle of the night

00:26:20.480 --> 00:26:21.330
and having their hands chopped off

00:26:21.330 --> 00:26:24.660
so thieves could steal their bracelets
and stuff, you know.

00:26:24.960 --> 00:26:26.160
Is it really that bad?

00:26:26.350 --> 00:26:27.250
You were still young then.

00:26:27.250 --> 00:26:29.910
It's understandable
you haven't heard of them.

00:26:33.630 --> 00:26:35.480
Mr. Han.

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:39.530
Didn't you say

00:26:39.530 --> 00:26:41.240
you wouldn't come to
my internet cafe anymore?

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:43.350
The internet in the dorms is too bad.

00:26:43.350 --> 00:26:45.010
I can't play at all.

00:26:45.940 --> 00:26:47.790
You haven't canceled my membership card,
have you?

00:26:47.790 --> 00:26:49.660
Is it too late for me to cancel it now?

00:26:49.660 --> 00:26:51.200
That's what makes you a boss, you know?

00:26:51.200 --> 00:26:52.610
You are so generous, boss.

00:26:52.610 --> 00:26:53.420
I promise

00:26:53.530 --> 00:26:56.070
I'll definitely keep my emotions
in check from now on.

00:26:56.070 --> 00:26:57.590
I won't smash keyboards anymore.

00:26:57.590 --> 00:26:59.450
I won't smash keyboards anymore.

00:26:59.700 --> 00:27:02.010
Let me introduce you
to a promising newcomer first.

00:27:02.010 --> 00:27:02.700
Li Cheng.

00:27:02.900 --> 00:27:03.420
Li Cheng,

00:27:03.420 --> 00:27:05.180
this is the best AD in our group,

00:27:05.180 --> 00:27:05.940
SN.

00:27:12.180 --> 00:27:13.350
What role do you play?

00:27:13.350 --> 00:27:14.050
Mid and Jungle.

00:27:14.050 --> 00:27:16.580
Next time we play together,
come bot lane more often.

00:27:16.580 --> 00:27:17.440
Guaranteed win.

00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:18.210
Sure.

00:27:18.330 --> 00:27:21.140
As long as bot lane doesn’t collapse,
I'll carry you to victory.

00:27:21.140 --> 00:27:22.300
Interesting.

00:27:22.460 --> 00:27:23.920
Come on, show me how you carry me.

00:27:23.920 --> 00:27:24.680
Come on, get online.

00:27:24.680 --> 00:27:26.400
-Carry me.
-You duo with Wei first.

00:27:26.400 --> 00:27:28.800
I still need to add him into
the group first.

00:27:29.030 --> 00:27:30.110
I'll send you the group ID.

00:27:30.110 --> 00:27:31.130
Send a request to join.

00:27:31.130 --> 00:27:31.760
Got it.

00:27:31.790 --> 00:27:32.620
Get online.

00:27:40.440 --> 00:27:41.180
I've sent it.

00:27:41.590 --> 00:27:42.350
Saw it.

00:27:42.580 --> 00:27:43.770
[Group Managers]
[Mr. Han, Feiyang, Wei]

00:27:43.770 --> 00:27:45.000
Alright, approved.

00:27:50.000 --> 00:27:51.460
It suddenly occurred to me

00:27:51.810 --> 00:27:52.720
that I had a friend

00:27:52.720 --> 00:27:54.240
who also lived in
the chemical plant dorms.

00:27:54.240 --> 00:27:55.140
His name was Bi Dehua.

00:27:55.140 --> 00:27:56.030
Do you know him?

00:27:59.770 --> 00:28:01.070
Bi Dehua?

00:28:03.000 --> 00:28:04.730
I only know Andy Lau—Liu Dehua.

00:28:05.750 --> 00:28:07.940
What happened to him back then
caused quite a stir.

00:28:07.940 --> 00:28:09.390
But it's good that you don't know.

00:28:09.390 --> 00:28:10.770
It wasn't anything good.

00:28:10.770 --> 00:28:11.880
The way you say that

00:28:11.880 --> 00:28:13.340
really whets my appetite.

00:28:17.220 --> 00:28:19.500
Back then, he was killed,

00:28:19.500 --> 00:28:21.360
and it was disguised as a suicide.

00:28:22.610 --> 00:28:24.500
Disguising it as suicide
is no small matter.

00:28:24.500 --> 00:28:25.590
That's not the most ridiculous part.

00:28:25.590 --> 00:28:27.110
You know what the most ridiculous part is?

00:28:27.110 --> 00:28:27.880
After he died,

00:28:27.880 --> 00:28:29.660
the police tested his blood

00:28:29.700 --> 00:28:31.700
and claimed he was the robber and rapist

00:28:31.700 --> 00:28:33.500
behind several previous cases.

00:28:35.640 --> 00:28:37.590
The case where several people were killed?

00:28:37.590 --> 00:28:38.570
I know that one.

00:28:38.570 --> 00:28:40.050
Our school actually
suspended classes at that time.

00:28:40.050 --> 00:28:41.510
Yeah, the 312 Case.

00:28:42.420 --> 00:28:43.240
But I always feel like

00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:45.180
he might have been framed.

00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:46.250
There's no way
things could be that coincidental—

00:28:46.250 --> 00:28:48.780
he died and immediately
became the murderer?

00:28:49.400 --> 00:28:50.750
I don't know about that.

00:28:50.880 --> 00:28:53.510
Maybe the police had some evidence.

00:29:01.010 --> 00:29:03.270
If trusting the police actually worked,

00:29:03.310 --> 00:29:04.610
then why are there so many good people
in this world

00:29:04.610 --> 00:29:06.340
who end up with no good outcome?

00:29:25.290 --> 00:29:26.740
Look at what you raised.

00:29:26.740 --> 00:29:28.010
He's just a darn loser!

00:29:28.010 --> 00:29:29.850
All he knows is surfing the internet,
playing games,

00:29:29.850 --> 00:29:30.830
and getting into fights!

00:29:30.830 --> 00:29:32.460
If you're so capable, you deal with him!

00:29:32.460 --> 00:29:33.510
Easy for you to say!

00:29:33.510 --> 00:29:34.640
You hypocrite!

00:29:35.550 --> 00:29:36.810
That summer vacation,

00:29:37.400 --> 00:29:38.680
I met Zhang Cheng and Chen Ping

00:29:38.680 --> 00:29:40.500
at an unlicensed internet cafe

00:29:41.140 --> 00:29:43.050
and started hanging out with them.

00:29:43.050 --> 00:29:43.770
I went against the life plan

00:29:43.770 --> 00:29:45.070
-my parents had in mind for me.
-Stop talking nonsense!

00:29:45.070 --> 00:29:46.030
If he actually took after you,
that'd be more troublesome!

00:29:46.030 --> 00:29:47.140
You bastard!

00:29:48.220 --> 00:29:50.620
But they didn't have time
to discipline me.

00:29:50.720 --> 00:29:52.310
They had their own pain.

00:29:53.180 --> 00:29:55.380
Although I was a loser in their eyes,

00:29:56.200 --> 00:29:58.380
I felt I should do something

00:29:58.610 --> 00:29:59.540
for this family.

00:30:14.210 --> 00:30:16.070
I'm going to dispose of the phone.

00:30:16.480 --> 00:30:19.010
You shouldn't have called
at a time like this.

00:30:20.440 --> 00:30:22.980
I want to go see you.

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:27.240
Soon you can.

00:30:28.640 --> 00:30:31.640
Do you remember the mooncakes
I brought you last time?

00:30:32.650 --> 00:30:33.380
I do.

00:30:36.770 --> 00:30:38.030
They were my favorite—

00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:41.500
the ones with red date paste filling.

00:30:42.010 --> 00:30:42.940
Did you eat them?

00:30:43.240 --> 00:30:44.010
No.

00:30:45.810 --> 00:30:47.940
It's not the Mid-Autumn Festival yet.

00:30:48.350 --> 00:30:49.350
But

00:30:50.000 --> 00:30:52.700
the moon is very full tonight.

00:30:56.400 --> 00:30:57.800
I know what you mean.

00:30:58.960 --> 00:31:00.400
We are

00:31:01.660 --> 00:31:02.590
the real family.

00:31:06.070 --> 00:31:08.420
Have you figured out
what to do with the novel?

00:31:08.420 --> 00:31:10.010
Let's delete Chapter 8.

00:31:10.940 --> 00:31:12.640
As for Chapter 7,

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:14.180
it's up to you.

00:31:15.720 --> 00:31:17.720
I might upload Chapter 7.

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:19.860
After all, it's been adapted.

00:31:25.830 --> 00:31:26.510
Goodbye.

00:31:28.720 --> 00:31:29.460
Goodbye.

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:36.420
♪ I once fell into a dream ♪

00:31:37.700 --> 00:31:41.130
♪ Inside I lost my name ♪

00:31:42.880 --> 00:31:46.450
♪ The sun shone on my face ♪

00:31:47.420 --> 00:31:53.830
♪ And left me ashamed, who is who? ♪

00:32:04.600 --> 00:32:05.240
♪ Who is who? ♪

00:32:06.320 --> 00:32:08.310
♪ Who bears the sin and still prays? ♪

00:32:09.430 --> 00:32:09.460
[Abyss]

00:32:09.460 --> 00:32:10.150
♪ Who is who? ♪

00:32:11.420 --> 00:32:11.470
♪ Who shut their eyes and cry for right? ♪

00:32:11.470 --> 00:32:13.500
[Chapter 8 of Abyss]

00:32:13.950 --> 00:32:14.200
[Chapter 8]

00:32:14.200 --> 00:32:14.530
♪ Why is the blade covered in blood? ♪

00:32:14.530 --> 00:32:16.920
That seemingly insignificant oversight

00:32:17.110 --> 00:32:17.940
♪ They call it justice ♪

00:32:17.940 --> 00:32:19.520
was like knocking over the first domino.

00:32:19.520 --> 00:32:21.220
♪ Why is killing so cold? ♪

00:32:21.570 --> 00:32:22.380
From that moment on,

00:32:22.380 --> 00:32:23.010
♪ They call it destiny ♪

00:32:23.010 --> 00:32:24.370
everything veered off course,

00:32:24.370 --> 00:32:24.670
♪ Why can't the savior be saved? ♪

00:32:24.670 --> 00:32:24.870
[The ash fell on the back of my hand
and I shivered.]

00:32:24.890 --> 00:32:25.110
[Turns out not all "carelessness"
can be forgiven.]

00:32:25.140 --> 00:32:25.260
[When some cracks appear,]

00:32:25.280 --> 00:32:25.460
[they will crawl into the heart
through the bone.]

00:32:25.490 --> 00:32:25.610
[I stared at the dark screen.]

00:32:25.630 --> 00:32:25.760
[I think I see my face reflected.]

00:32:25.780 --> 00:32:26.000
[It's as pale as a ghost.
Why is the night so long?]

00:32:26.030 --> 00:32:26.170
[Every second is like
being soaked in ice.]

00:32:26.200 --> 00:32:26.300
[My bones are trembling from the cold.]

00:32:26.420 --> 00:32:27.220
sliding toward an uncontrollable abyss.

00:32:27.220 --> 00:32:29.080
♪ Why do my foes guard me? ♪

00:32:30.130 --> 00:32:31.080
♪ Why did they chain your two hands? ♪

00:32:31.840 --> 00:32:35.720
♪ And then judge when declare? ♪

00:32:37.670 --> 00:32:39.640
♪ Look, now you face the darkness ♪

00:32:40.550 --> 00:32:41.290
♪ Darkness stares back at you ♪

00:32:42.360 --> 00:32:44.370
♪ All things will fade into night ♪

00:32:45.170 --> 00:32:49.610
♪ Your mind will break then take off ♪

00:32:52.120 --> 00:32:52.310
[Private Area
No Admittance for Customers]

00:32:52.310 --> 00:32:53.740
His room was very clean,

00:32:53.740 --> 00:32:54.830
with only a few pieces of furniture

00:32:54.830 --> 00:32:56.270
and nothing particularly unusual—

00:32:56.270 --> 00:32:58.550
except for a photo
that had been cut into two-thirds

00:32:58.550 --> 00:33:00.000
of Han Pinmu from a few years ago,

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.460
taken together with someone his age.